        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Emit Musk"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(olfactory)\n\nThe giant pangolin releases a disorienting and repulsive musk within a 5-foot emanation. Each creature in the area must attempt a 20 Fortitude save. The pangolin can't Emit Musk again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature becomes temporarily immune to pangolin musk for 1 minute.\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is sickened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature becomes sickened 1 and is flat-footed until no longer sickened."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
