            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Roll Up"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(move)\n\nThe giant pangolin falls prone and rolls up into a ball. While rolled up, the only actions the giant pangolin can perform are Emit Musk and Stand, and it also becomes blinded and gains resistance 10 to physical damage. An adjacent creature that hits a rolled-up giant pangolin with a melee Strike takes 1d6 slashing damage.\n\nThese effects end once the giant pangolin Stands."
            },
